@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Monthly report for October 2026 (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports?type=MONTHLY&date=2026-10-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daily / weekly (Monday to Sunday) / annual
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports?type=DAILY&date=2026-10-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports?type=WEEKLY&date=2026-10-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports?type=ANNUAL&date=2026-06-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download the PDF
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/export?type=MONTHLY&date=2026-10-15&format=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download the CSV
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/export?type=MONTHLY&date=2026-10-15&format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown type -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports?type=HOURLY
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown format -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/export?type=MONTHLY&format=docx
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
